<p>Alwida Fatema (3)</p>

<p>Haye Baad baba ke jo guzri wo Musibat sunlo<br />
Ya ali fatema zehra ki wasiyat sunlo</p>

<p>Aaj rukhsat ho rhi hai Tumse zehra Ya Ali(3)</p>

<p>Parda e shab mein meri mayyat uthana Ya Ali<br />
Aaj ruksat........</p>

<p>1. Pasliya todi gai kaise ye batlaungi mai<br />
Hashr ke maidaa'n mein bhi is haal mein aaungi mai<br />
Haath pehlu se na tum mera hatana Ya Ali<br />
Aaj rukhsat.....</p>

<p>2. Wo musibat aap ne achcha hua dekhi nahi<br />
Ab mai sidhe haath se tasbih padh sakti nahi<br />
Aisa kunfuz ne hai mara taziyana Ya Ali<br />
Aaj rukhsat....</p>

<p>3. Haye....<br />
Kehti hai zainab ye mujhse dekhkar chehra mera<br />
Aapke rukhsaar par ye neel hai kaisa pada<br />
Are<br />
Maine khaya hai tamacha, Mat batana ya ali<br />
Aaj ruksat.....</p>

<p>4. Taziyane ki aziyyat ka uthana ek taraf<br />
Wo tamache, qatle mohsin, dar jalana ek taraf<br />
Sabse mushkil tha magar darbaar jana ya ali<br />
Aaj ruksat.....</p>

<p>5. Jab meri talqeen padhna yaad kar lena zara<br />
Dar ke girne se mera baazu bhi hai toota hua<br />
Mere shano ko zara dhire hilana ya ali<br />
Aaj ruksat.....</p>

<p>6. Haye.....<br />
Chahe aajaye qayamat mujhse ye waada karo<br />
Jab talak maula mere shabbir ki marzi na ho<br />
Are<br />
Tab talak mera janaza mat uthana ya ali.....<br />
Aaj ruksat.....</p>

<p>7. Jab se aayi hu palat kar fikr hai mujhko yehi<br />
Mai to parde mein gai fir bhi zaeefa ho gayi<br />
Berida darbaar hai zainab ko jana ya ali....<br />
Aaj ruksat......</p>

<p>8. Karbala mein jab mere mazloom par khanjar chale<br />
Pyaas k aalam me wo ghazi ko jab aawaaz de<br />
Mai bhi aaungi waha par tum bhi aana ya ali.....<br />
Aaj ruksat.....</p>

<p>9. Haye...<br />
Haath pehlu pr rakhe boli takallum fatema<br />
Mai dua krti hu tum aamin keh dena zara<br />
Jald aaye mere Mahdi ka zamana ya ali.....<br />
Ya ali..............<br />
Aaj ruksat.......</p>